---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';

const email = 'illusivelightworks@gmail.com';
const updated = '16 November 2026';
---
<Site title="Terms of Use | Illusive Lightworks" description="The terms for using ILW Light Mapper, including the Pro subscription.">
	<main class="legal">
		<h1>Terms of Use</h1>
		<p class="lede">Last updated {updated}. These terms apply to the ILW Light Mapper app and illusivelightworks.com, made by Illusive Lightworks.</p>

		<h2>Using the app</h2>
		<p>The app is licensed to you under Apple's standard <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a>, which is part of these terms. If the two disagree, Apple's agreement wins for anything it covers.</p>

		<h2>Free and Pro</h2>
		<p>The app is free to use with one project. ILW Light Mapper Pro is an optional auto-renewing subscription that adds unlimited projects, project export and sharing, and the beta auto beat from the microphone. What each includes is shown on the Pro page in the app, and it can change between versions; projects you have already made are never locked or removed.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Payment is charged to your Apple ID when you confirm. A free trial, if offered, becomes a paid subscription unless you cancel before it ends.</li>
			<li>The subscription renews automatically unless it is cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel it in your Apple ID settings, and refunds are handled by Apple.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Your content</h2>
		<p>Your projects and any pictures or videos you bring into the app are yours and stay on your device. You are responsible for having the right to use anything you import, and for how and where you project it. Artwork and shaders in the app's library are credited to their makers in the app's Credits screen.</p>

		<h2>Projecting safely</h2>
		<p>Moving light, strobing and high-contrast effects can affect people who are sensitive to flashing images. Use the app responsibly, make sure you are allowed to project where you do, and do not point projectors at people's eyes.</p>

		<h2>No warranty</h2>
		<p>The app and the website are provided as they are, without warranties of any kind. To the extent the law allows, Illusive Lightworks is not liable for losses arising from using them, including lost projects, so keep your own backups of anything important (you can export a project once you have Pro).</p>

		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>We may update these terms and will change the date above when we do. Continuing to use the app after a change means you accept it.</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p><a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a></p>
		<p>See also our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
	</main>
</Site>

<style is:global>
	.legal { max-width:760px; margin:0 auto; padding:24px 24px 56px; }
	.legal h1 { font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.2rem); margin:.2em 0 .1em; }
	.legal .lede { color:var(--muted); font-size:1.05rem; margin:0 0 18px; }
	.legal h2 { font-size:1.3rem; margin:30px 0 8px; }
	.legal p, .legal li { color:var(--text); }
	.legal ul { padding-left:1.2em; }
	.legal li { margin:6px 0; }
</style>
